            "title": "Voters want to pump the brakes on AI, chip sales to China, new poll shows - BizPac Review",
            "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOaHJkdUxXeHVWNlRyMlJaNVlLazVmdGtuUFBiNF9Va0VQWklob1ZicXdURmlxcUs1TkU2bnlCd0ozTHJwWFNnN3VlX01hRTJpYzlLc1hBME80cTN2ckpWRWlmTkd5MzVYaV9LN2pMZUZYeS1vM2M5WU1oYjQ2aVZyM0pwbUk1OUlHRE9IOUlQU0RSdWoySVlLU2xRQ0FuNVZjTnFHV19jbi1mSC01OTRDbUlaTzc0c1d1NGZBWQ?oc=5",
